BT 1 0 0 1 0 65.4 Tm .646684 Tw 12.4 TL /F5 9 Tf .058824 .090196 .164706 rg (Theme 2 - Supervised air quality classification using tabular and remote-sensing features.) Tj /F3 9 Tf ( Raza et al. \(2022\) [3] combined decision trees) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.295158 Tw (and temporal convolutional networks for sensor risk prediction, reporting 98% accuracy on local sensor records. Togunwa et al. \(2023\) [4]) Tj T* 0 Tw .328882 Tw (evaluated hybrid neural networks with Random Forest on compact physiologic and environmental records, reporting 94.88% accuracy. Jamel et) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.101048 Tw (al. \(2024\) [5] proposed PCA coupled with TreeNet, achieving 98.25% reported accuracy. Al Mashrafi et al. \(2024\) [6] and Abdulla-Hil-Kafi et al.) Tj T* 0 Tw .409611 Tw (\(2024\) [7] benchmarked supervised classifiers across regional health datasets. The central limitation of these approaches is their dependence on) Tj T* 0 Tw (pre-existing labelled training classes; they do not demonstrate independent unsupervised cluster discovery across unmonitored geographies.) Tj T* ET
