BT 1 0 0 1 0 53 Tm 1.194471 Tw 12.4 TL /F5 9 Tf .058824 .090196 .164706 rg (Theme 3 - Recent environmental and spatial pattern grouping models.) Tj /F3 9 Tf ( Tzimourta et al. \(2025\) [8] evaluated multi-feature classification) Tj T* 0 Tw .927579 Tw (baselines, reporting 88.03% accuracy. Pi et al. \(2025\) [9] achieved 82% accuracy using a multilayer perceptron on compact sensory profiles.) Tj T* 0 Tw .586526 Tw (Samara \(2025\) [10] and Adeniyi et al. \(2025\) [11] examined IoT-derived sensor records, reporting 77% and 88% accuracy respectively. These) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.02575 Tw (studies emphasize that simple, computationally efficient architectures provide robust baselines; however, their metrics depend heavily on specific) Tj T* 0 Tw (label splits and cannot directly generalize to transboundary airsheds without calibration.) Tj T* ET
