BT 1 0 0 1 0 77.8 Tm 1.0414 Tw 12.4 TL /F5 9 Tf .058824 .090196 .164706 rg (Theme 4 - Dataset scale, airshed carrying capacity, and emerging methods \(2026\).) Tj /F3 9 Tf ( Hossain et al. \(2026\) [12] curated 6,058 clinical and) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.896875 Tw (environmental sensor records, achieving 99.34% XGBoost accuracy. Amin et al. \(2026\) [13] evaluated 1,205 multi-variable records with) Tj T* 0 Tw .430529 Tw (Gradient Boosting, reporting 98.17% accuracy. Yoseph and Mussie \(2026\) [14] studied longitudinal dropout patterns, while Altaie and Ibrahim) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.874533 Tw (\(2026\) [15] emphasized leakage-aware validation \(80% accuracy, AUC 0.911\). Auxilia and Thirugnanam \(2026\) [16] employed AutoML) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.506882 Tw (ensembles \(82.85% accuracy, AUC 0.9539\), and Moon et al. \(2026\) [17] introduced explainable stacking \(99.58% accuracy\). Table 1) Tj T* 0 Tw .423733 Tw (summarizes these representative studies; their supervised metrics provide context for understanding atmospheric feature interactions rather than) Tj T* 0 Tw (like-for-like clustering benchmarks.) Tj T* ET
